    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sexual content:</strong> Features sexy images and animations to make the story even more engaging, while adding a healthy dose of romance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448160/extras/d9f2251710220d453076340bdb124eee.avif?t=1747408999\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complex characters:</strong> Interact with a variety of interesting characters, each with their own personality, background, and motivations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448160/extras/b1a9362813c7b110f83f966ed0654d48.avif?t=1747408999\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating story:</strong> Dive into deep and complex themes (some of them bittersweet) without forgetting moments of good humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448160/extras/b1cf6a49a2e5472bb27fb61bf1f434eb.avif?t=1747408999\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful choices:</strong> Your decisions will have consequences throughout the game, impacting your relationships with the characters and the story\u2019s ending. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are a 32-year-old writer who has just published your first Best Seller, but you feel unsatisfied with your life. Tormented by a recent divorce and traumatic memories, it's time to confront your past and heal old wounds.</strong></